{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>And I will bless her.</b> In conception, in birth, and in raising the son without pain — the reverse of the curse of Eve in His saying, בְּעֶצֶב תֵּלְדִי בָּנִים (Genesis 3:16). He states that Sarah will conceive, give birth, and raise her son without pain, as the Sages say: אֲשֶׁר פָּדָה אֶת אַבְרָהָם (Isaiah 29:22) — that He redeemed Abraham from the pain of raising children."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {0 "Sforno quotes the Sages' reading of Isaiah 29:22, interpreting פדה as redemption from the pain of child-rearing."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:30:29.427383772Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}